B.Mh=s(["Here are the prices:","Walks: $25 for each hour.\nBoarding, small dogs: $45 a day.\nBoarding, large dogs: $50 to $55 a day.\nDrop-in visits: DARKULY tells you when he answers.","The final total depends on your dog and your days. DARKULY confirms it when he accepts your request."],t.s)
